    "description": "The Gray-Scott reaction-diffusion equation drives Physarum slime-mold pattern formation chemically. Two species U + V diffuse and react; for F=0.025, k=0.056 the pattern develops labyrinthine stripes — the same topology a real slime mold paints with its body. Snapshot at step 1000.",
